---
import LegalLayout from "../layouts/LegalLayout.astro";
import { site } from "../config/site";
---

<LegalLayout title="Accessibility Statement" description="Accessibility of the Ocho Glasgow website. Draft for review.">
  <h2>Our aim</h2>
  <p>
    We want everyone to be able to use this website. It has been designed and built with the Web Content Accessibility
    Guidelines (WCAG) 2.2 level AA as the target.
  </p>

  <h2>What we have done</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Pages work with a keyboard, and have a "skip to content" link.</li>
    <li>Text and buttons have been checked for colour contrast.</li>
    <li>Photos have text descriptions.</li>
    <li>Animations are switched off if your device is set to reduce motion.</li>
    <li>Pages work on small screens and when zoomed in.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Known limitations</h2>
  <p>
    Online ordering (Flipdish) and table booking (Dojo) are provided by third parties and shown inside our pages. We
    cannot fully control how accessible they are. If you have any trouble, please call us and we will help.
  </p>
  <p>[Record the results of a full accessibility audit before launch.]</p>

  <h2>Contact us</h2>
  <p>
    If something doesn't work for you, call <a href={`tel:${site.phone.e164}`}>{site.phone.display}</a> or email
    [EMAIL].
  </p>

  <p>This statement was last reviewed on [DATE].</p>
</LegalLayout>
